# LF everywhere, on every checkout. A Windows clone with core.autocrlf turned scripts/*.sh into
# CRLF and bash died on line 1 (`set -uo pipefail\r`: "invalid option name"). Binaries untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text
